          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyamukaku, chaku; muloŋa mwaana weyi wunenzi, nikulema kwaYehova kunakutuntukili.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.60.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.60.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 60:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.60.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.60.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 60:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akutúuka neyi ivu, neyi atupompa akuya muyisu yawu, hiyanyi?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.60.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.60.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 60:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.60.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.60.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 60:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eyi muntu alekeluwu, aheleluwu chakwila nimuntu wukuhita mweyeyinehi, nakakubalumuna kwikala kulema kwahaya nyaka, nikuzanajala kwamakipu amavulu amba kavwalikaŋa antu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.60.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.60.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 60:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waka amwamayeli anyuza, wakaamwa kumayeli awanyanta; wakeluka neyi ami Yehova yami chamwinu cheyi, yami nkúuli yeyi, yami Mukwaŋovu waYakoba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.60.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.60.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 60:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muwunenunaka hiŋashamu wuru, muchikuŋu nakahiŋishamu siliva, mumutondu nakahiŋisha muwuneŋu, mumalola nakahiŋishamu chikuŋu. Atulama tweyi nakayibalumuna kwikala kuwunda, akwakufutisha akwawu nakayibalu munakwikala kuloŋa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.60.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.60.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 60:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Madombu hiyakayitiya nawa cheŋa mwituŋa deyuku, kukisaŋana nakujilumuna hichakatiyakana mupinza jeyuku. Mpwembujeyi wakajitumba ijina, neyi Wamwinu, yisu yakumpwembu, neyi Kushimeka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.60.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.60.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 60:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Itaŋwa hidakakutoŋekela nawa cheŋi namwaanaku; nikakweji hikakakutoŋekela cheŋi nawa kulonda wumoni mwejuku, Yehova diyi wakekala mwaana weyi wahaya nyaka, Nzambi yeyi diyi wakekala lubanji lweyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.60.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.60.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 60:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Itaŋwa deyi hidakahuma nawa chepuku, nikakweji keyi hikakafwaku, muloŋa Yehova diyi wakekala chejeji cheyi chahaya nyaka, mafuku eyi akudila anamani dehi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.60.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.60.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 60:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Antu eyi nawa akekala aloŋa ejima, akaswana ituŋa chahaya nyaka, womutayi wunatumbili, womudimu wakumakasami, kulonda lubanji lwami lwakamwekani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.60.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.60.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 60:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kakehelamu kakabalumuka ikombakaji, wadiŋi wanyanya wakekala muza waŋovu. Ami Yehova yami nakachinyakisha hamwaka wachu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.60.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.60.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
